---
description: Preserve a reviewed checkpoint after every major feature or refactor iteration
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/WORKFLOW.md` for all implementation work.
After each major feature or refactor iteration, save a focused commit, its
validation record under `docs/checkpoints/`, and an annotated Git tag named
`checkpoint/YYYY-MM-DD-<iteration>`.
Keep tags immutable and distinguish review-only, verified, and incomplete results.
Never commit another person's changes or private game data as part of a checkpoint.
